    },
    "review": "Empty wrist-worn native container; add actual owned wands separately. Drawing and stowing a stored wand is mentally directed and free even outside your turn. Source refers to a normal wand bracer without giving a numeric capacity; none is invented. PF1 container sheets do not expose activation actions, so retrieval remains a manual inventory procedure. Illustrated wands are examples, not bundled contents."
  },
