    "contents": [],
    "capacity": {
      "slots": 5
    },
    "review": "Five empty object slots, one suitably shaped alchemical creation, dust, oil or potion each; retrieve one as a move action. Slot count is not a weight capacity. No consumables are bundled. Bomb generation begins only at the separate 6th-level 4800 gp upgrade; higher damage/price tiers are not active in this base variant. Transient bombs cannot be stockpiled or passed along; no unlimited grenade inventory or attack is granted."
  },
  "bottomless-flask": {
    "containerId": "1971a8808a390a8f",
