    },
    "contents": [],
    "capacity": {
      "compartments": 5,
      "gallonsPerCompartment": 20
    },
    "review": "Empty two-pound container with five separate twenty-gallon extradimensional spaces. Twist the stopper as a swift action to select a space; pour at most one pint or one alchemical flask per round into a square within reach. Liquids remain separated, including volatile substances; breaking the flask loses all contents. Gallons are not converted to a guessed pound capacity. Compartment choice, volume and pouring are manual; the source gives no explicit carried-weight exemption, so automatic weight reduction remains deferred. No nested compartments or liquids are fabricated."
  }
